---
layout: base.njk
section: home
---
<div class="hero">
  <div class="plate">
    <div class="photo mono">PHOTO</div>
  </div>
  <div>
    <p class="lede">Hi! I'm Oliver. I love gadgets, I love to read American history, and I love low-level programming.</p>
    <p>These topics take up a lot of my head space, so I wanted a place for those thoughts to settle. Writing forces me to articulate them and re-examine the obvious questions, which makes learning feel more concrete.</p>
    <p>I'm starting this blog to build a habit of learning, made more intentional through writing.</p>
    <div class="rail mono">
      <a href="{{ site.links.github }}">github</a>
      <a href="{{ site.links.email }}">email</a>
      <a href="{{ '/feed.xml' | url }}">rss</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="recent">
  <h2>Recent</h2>
  <ul>
    {%- for post in collections.everything | take(5) %}
    <li>
      <span class="when">{{ post.date | date }}</span>
      <span>
        <a href="{{ post.data.link or (post.url | url) }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a>
        <span class="where">— {{ post.data.section | sectionTitle }}</span>
      </span>
    </li>
    {%- else %}
    <li><span class="where">Nothing posted yet.</span></li>
    {%- endfor %}
  </ul>
</section>
